## 5. How to Demo / Test

Use [`03_US125266_TEST_Simple.sql`](../Scripts/US-125266/03_US125266_TEST_Simple.sql) — plain-English, no SQL expertise needed beyond running a query and reading a number.

**Issue 1 demo:**
1. Run the headline count query — shows how many loans are currently stuck in the old "missed forever" gap.
2. Trigger the job (ask DEV/DBA support), or use the safe, self-undoing test run at the bottom of the script.
3. Re-run the same query — the count should drop, because those loans now have a queue entry.

**Issue 2 demo:**
1. Run the `IncorrectlyQueuedCount` query — note the number (may be non-zero already, see Section 4).
2. Trigger the job again.
3. Re-run the same query — the count should **not increase**. A flat number before/after proves no new wrong-year record was created, even for agencies with two tax years eligible at once.

